<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>A Little Love Reminder</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      color: #4c2638;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe1e9, #fff3dc);
    }

    .card {
      width: min(100%, 680px);
      padding: 36px;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(105, 45, 70, 0.16);
    }

    h1 { color: #b4426b; }

    p { line-height: 1.7; }

    input {
      width: min(100%, 320px);
      margin: 12px 0;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #e7b4c4;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    button {
      margin: 8px;
      padding: 11px 22px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: white;
      background: #c75279;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover { background: #a83b62; }

    .secondary { background: #8e7180; }

    .error {
      min-height: 24px;
      color: #b4233d;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .poem {
      max-height: 55vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: left;
      white-space: pre-line;
      background: #fff8fa;
      border-radius: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .stars button {
      padding: 8px;
      color: #e4a900;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <section id="intro">
      <h1>A Little Love Reminder 💌</h1>
      <p>
        This is an offline reminder that love beyond a normal text
        can be something truly awesome.
      </p>
      <button onclick="showPage('namePage')">Continue</button>
    </section>

    <section id="namePage" hidden>
      <h1>Before you continue…</h1>
      <p>Are you MELLISA?</p>
      <button onclick="showPage('passPage')">Yes</button>
      <button class="secondary" onclick="denyAccess()">No</button>
      <p class="error" id="nameMessage" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <section id="passPage" hidden>
      <h1>Passcode required 🔐</h1>
      <p>Enter the passcode to read your message.</p>
      <input id="passcode" type="password" placeholder="Passcode" />
      <br />
      <button onclick="checkPasscode()">Unlock</button>
      <p class="error" id="passMessage" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <section id="poemPage" hidden>
      <h1>From a Warning to Destiny 💖</h1>
      <div class="poem">They told me, "Don't fall," keep your heart locked away,
But you hit my phone and changed my whole day.
One little message had me feeling too much,
Trading the distance for a digital touch.
Late-night calls became my ultimate peace,
Watching the walls I built slowly cease.
They said it’s just pixels, it isn't quite real,
But they didn't know how you made my heart feel.
We laughed at the past while building our dreams,
Mending the fabric of life at the seams.
Even when clashing or arguing late,
I'd still choose you, girl, and accept our own fate.
If love is a gamble, I'm betting it all,
Proudly defying the warning to fall.
One day we'll show them the texts that we saved,
All of the late nights and plans that we paved.
They’ll see two young hearts on a glowing screen,
Becoming the greatest thing they've ever seen.
And when our kids ask how the story began,
We’ll say we were teenagers, holding a hand.
From a warning to destiny, bright and so free,
You grew a small screen to a family tree.
You became my forever, my whole reality.</div>
      <button onclick="showPage('ratingPage')">Continue to rating</button>
    </section>

    <section id="ratingPage" hidden>
      <h1>How would you rate it? 💕</h1>
      <p>Choose a rating from 1 to 5 stars.</p>
      <div class="stars" aria-label="Rate the poem">
        <button aria-label="1 star" onclick="rate(1)">★</button>
        <button aria-label="2 stars" onclick="rate(2)">★</button>
        <button aria-label="3 stars" onclick="rate(3)">★</button>
        <button aria-label="4 stars" onclick="rate(4)">★</button>
        <button aria-label="5 stars" onclick="rate(5)">★</button>
      </div>
      <p id="ratingMessage" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    function showPage(pageId) {
      document.querySelectorAll("main section").forEach(section => {
        section.hidden = section.id !== pageId;
      });
    }

    function denyAccess() {
      document.getElementById("nameMessage").textContent =
        "Access denied. This reminder is for MELLISA.";
    }

    function checkPasscode() {
      const entered = document.getElementById("passcode").value;
      if (entered === "Abshley") {
        showPage("poemPage");
      } else {
        document.getElementById("passMessage").textContent =
          "That passcode isn't correct. Please try again.";
      }
    }

    function rate(stars) {
      document.getElementById("ratingMessage").textContent =
        `Thank you for rating it ${stars} out of 5 stars! 💗`;
    }

    document.getElementById("passcode").addEventListener("keydown", event => {
      if (event.key === "Enter") checkPasscode();
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
